From: taimen camera bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] soft ISP: contrast autofocus

Sharpness stat + hill-climb Af (brightness-normalised, AE warm-up
before scanning). The Af reports its target as LensPosition metadata;
the simple pipeline drives the CameraLens from it. Enabled via the
imx362 tuning file.

